  {:id "decl-static-assert" :what "static assertions with and without a message at file, block and member scope"
   :clause "6.7.12" :annex-a "static_assert-declaration"
   :m2 "static_assert without a message; static_assert a keyword"
   :top "static_assert(sizeof(int) >= 2, \"int is at least 16 bits\");\nstatic_assert(1 + 1 == 2);\n_Static_assert(1, \"old spelling\");\n_Static_assert(2 > 1);\nstruct sa { int x; static_assert(1); };"
